  {
   "id": 673679,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Reflect on a time in your early childhood when you wanted to take initiative in a new activity or social situation. How did the adults around you respond? Did their response encourage or discourage your sense of initiative? How does your experience relate to Erikson’s stage, initiative versus guilt? How do you think this experience has influenced your willingness to take initiative in new situations today?",
